{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.HEADSPACE is a 2D adventure game that combines pixel art and hand drawn styles to immerse the player in a psychological adventure through a fractured landscape. Play as an unknown wanderer who has lost his memory and interact with a diverse cast of characters who may or may not have your best interest at heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle, visual novel, and walking sim elements weave together as you strive to unlock who you are and how to get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fully realized OST with intricately composed music by the inimitable Magic From Space, who also assisted with sound effects and contributed voice line work.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347280?t=1756244065","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347280?t=1756244065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347280/bd05640afc8b95d662b2e18bdcc0f5257dbb6fe2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756244065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347280/bd05640afc8b95d662b2e18bdcc0f5257dbb6fe2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756244065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of despair, depression, dissociation, trauma, and verbal abuse. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.HEADSPACE is a 2D adventure game that combines pixel art and hand drawn styles to immerse the player in a psychological adventure through a fractured landscape. Play as an unknown wanderer who has lost his memory and interact with a diverse cast of characters who may or may not have your best interest at heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p 